1
00:00:23,280 --> 00:00:26,920
The moon shines bright upon the pond,

2
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:31,000
Riding a bamboo horse across Hongtang.

3
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:33,920
Hongtang's waters run too deep to cross,

4
00:00:33,920 --> 00:00:35,759
I don't need your protection!

5
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:40,240
A bride rows her boat to fetch her groom.

6
00:00:42,479 --> 00:00:43,079
Don't worry.

7
00:00:44,439 --> 00:00:45,079
Once I return home,

8
00:00:46,359 --> 00:00:47,119
I'll marry you right away.

9
00:00:49,799 --> 00:00:51,399
Who said I'd marry you?

10
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:53,679
Then...

11
00:00:54,479 --> 00:00:55,359
if you don't marry me,

12
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:56,960
who will you marry?

13
00:00:58,079 --> 00:00:58,679
I...

14
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:00,079
I'm not telling you!

15
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:16,280
Lian Ye!

16
00:02:17,319 --> 00:02:17,960
Lian Ye!

17
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:12,360
It's so late. Is something wrong?

18
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:18,039
I'm delivering the intel tomorrow.

19
00:03:21,759 --> 00:03:23,599
I've faced the Grim Reaper many times.

20
00:03:24,599 --> 00:03:25,759
I've won every time.

21
00:03:27,680 --> 00:03:28,759
Look at you bragging.

22
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,280
But I can't keep winning forever.

23
00:03:32,919 --> 00:03:34,439
Don't talk nonsense.

24
00:03:36,599 --> 00:03:37,319
What if...

25
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:39,599
I mean, what if...

26
00:03:40,879 --> 00:03:42,000
I don't make it back,

27
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:45,400
could you do me a favor?

28
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,800
You won't ask me to look after Lian Ye?

29
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,759
Of course not.

30
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:53,439
You have your own life.

31
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:56,000
I have no right to ask that of you.

32
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:59,319
Besides, he's a grown man.

33
00:03:59,759 --> 00:04:01,159
He can take care of himself.

34
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:04,960
I only hope...

35
00:04:07,759 --> 00:04:09,479
when things get hardest for him,

36
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:12,520
you can brew him a cup of jasmine tea.

37
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:15,479
Growing up,

38
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:19,319
his mother and I always brewed it for him.

39
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,759
It'll make him feel better.

40
00:04:28,959 --> 00:04:30,639
I... I don't know how to brew it.

41
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:33,360
You should be the one to do it.

42
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,040
Alright.

43
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:39,279
I...

44
00:04:40,759 --> 00:04:41,360
I promise.

45
00:05:04,120 --> 00:05:05,040
Inukai Kai

46
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:07,360
is furious about the raids

47
00:05:08,199 --> 00:05:09,000
on the supply depot and POW camp.

48
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:10,319
They rounded up over a hundred

49
00:05:10,319 --> 00:05:11,360
innocent Rongcheng civilians.

50
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:12,920
Tomorrow at noon,

51
00:05:13,439 --> 00:05:15,279
they'll be executed outside Xichan Temple

52
00:05:15,959 --> 00:05:17,079
in retaliation against us.

53
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,639
We're the ones who did it.

54
00:05:21,279 --> 00:05:23,319
Why drag innocent civilians into this?

55
00:05:23,959 --> 00:05:25,079
The Japanese are taking it out on them,

56
00:05:26,399 --> 00:05:27,519
slaughtering the innocent.

57
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:29,920
I'm going to rescue them.

58
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:30,959
You can't.

59
00:05:31,519 --> 00:05:33,160
The Japanese clearly set a trap,

60
00:05:33,160 --> 00:05:33,920
waiting for us to walk right into it!

61
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,240
If we don't save them,

62
00:05:42,839 --> 00:05:44,480
are we just supposed to let

63
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,360
those innocent people die?

64
00:05:46,959 --> 00:05:47,480
By the way,

65
00:05:48,079 --> 00:05:48,879
the Organization

66
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:50,439
received the intel we sent.

67
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:52,519
They sent a message over the radio

68
00:05:52,959 --> 00:05:53,680
saying reinforcements will arrive

69
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,360
at dawn the day after tomorrow.

70
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,519
As long as we hold out until then,

71
00:05:58,319 --> 00:05:59,199
we can all make it out alive.

72
00:06:01,279 --> 00:06:02,199
If we want to rescue them now,

73
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:05,160
we must come up with a foolproof plan.

74
00:06:09,240 --> 00:06:10,199
Tomorrow night, Inukai Kai

75
00:06:10,399 --> 00:06:11,560
is having dancers perform at his manor.

76
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:13,839
This is your best chance to sneak in,

77
00:06:14,079 --> 00:06:15,439
assassinate him, and rescue Lian Yu.

78
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:17,480
Reinforcements arrive in two days.

79
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:20,240
The guerrillas will engage the Japanese

80
00:06:20,639 --> 00:06:21,399
in the city to pin them down.

81
00:06:23,079 --> 00:06:25,199
So I am the best person

82
00:06:25,519 --> 00:06:26,360
to go and save them.

83
00:06:28,959 --> 00:06:29,680
It's settled.

84
00:06:56,399 --> 00:06:57,279
Since you don't like drinking,

85
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,879
I scrounged from Captain Xu

86
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,879
some Yongtai green tea

87
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,600
to brew for you.

88
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,920
Is your tea even drinkable?

89
00:07:14,279 --> 00:07:15,079
Minmin taught me.

90
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:19,000
Just drink it, don't worry.

91
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,519
It won't give you diarrhea.

92
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:58,199
Do you remember when we were kids?

93
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:02,439
We lived in Three Lanes and Seven Alleys.

94
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:04,600
Me,

95
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:07,120
you,

96
00:08:10,399 --> 00:08:11,000
Wang Dali,

97
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:17,439
and Minmin.

98
00:08:19,519 --> 00:08:22,399
All of us played together every day.

99
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,639
That's amazing!

100
00:08:29,639 --> 00:08:30,519
Awesome!

101
00:08:32,519 --> 00:08:32,960
Here you go.

102
00:08:35,240 --> 00:08:35,919
This is mine!

103
00:08:36,879 --> 00:08:38,480
Whatever I want is mine!

104
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,600
It's his!

105
00:08:39,759 --> 00:08:40,399
Give it back to him!

106
00:08:47,639 --> 00:08:48,159
Get him!

107
00:09:34,279 --> 00:09:35,279
It seems ever since we were kids,

108
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,600
you've always been like this,

109
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,200
always standing in front of us.

110
00:09:43,279 --> 00:09:44,200
I'm older than all of you.

111
00:09:45,440 --> 00:09:46,240
That's how it should be.

112
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,879
Come back alive.

113
00:09:59,399 --> 00:10:00,279
You must come back alive.

114
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:04,080
Then I get to be your big brother.

115
00:10:04,879 --> 00:10:05,639
I'll protect you.

116
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:13,200
You said it.

117
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,240
You can't go back on your word.

118
00:10:37,559 --> 00:10:38,320
Mingyuan

119
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:53,919
I raised you with my own two hands.

120
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:56,159
Back then,

121
00:10:57,159 --> 00:10:58,559
I was afraid I wouldn't raise you right,

122
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:01,000
yet afraid I'd raise you too well.

123
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,360
I kept telling you to quit,

124
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,840
to stop being a cop,

125
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,720
just fearing this day would come.

126
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,600
Still,

127
00:11:13,440 --> 00:11:14,320
as your father,

128
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:17,200
I have to let you have your way for once.

129
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:19,639
Go on.

130
00:12:00,960 --> 00:12:01,759
In this hour of national peril,

131
00:12:03,039 --> 00:12:06,399
the Japanese massacre Rongcheng's people.

132
00:12:07,759 --> 00:12:09,240
This is beyond endurance!

133
00:12:10,759 --> 00:12:12,080
As police officers of Rongcheng,

134
00:12:12,879 --> 00:12:13,960
we must defend our homeland

135
00:12:13,960 --> 00:12:14,759
and lead from the front.

136
00:12:17,279 --> 00:12:19,600
There's no coming back from this mission.

137
00:12:21,759 --> 00:12:22,879
You all have families and loved ones.

138
00:12:24,039 --> 00:12:25,279
I can't make this decision for you.

139
00:12:26,759 --> 00:12:29,200
If you have doubts, you won't be forced.

140
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,519
If you're willing, follow me.

141
00:12:36,480 --> 00:12:37,039
Move out!
